+ * cannot see. Read these kinds as "which handle classes DIRECTLY hold the set, and how many
+ * witnesses are still live" — a triage funnel, never a proof of absence.
+ *
+ * ATOMICITY. All nine values are fields of ONE snapshot: kind 17 recomputes the whole snapshot
+ * (set build + a single handle walk + witness count) and returns its monotonic sequence
